        <head>WHY DO CHILDREN</head>
        <p>WHY DO CHILDREN</p>
        <p>Cough more than adults? is a question nearly unanswerable, but the reason may be that the delicate breathing mechanism in the young has not had time to get in sufficiently good running order, or ensured against cold, microbes, or the vagaries of the change- ab!e British climate. Whooping</p>
