        <p>Hill CHM Baptist Church. On April 3rd a very succeseful tea and social eveniog was held, organized by the men of the congregation, on behalf of the New Organ Fund. The tables artistically laid, and the ladies pr?sent were agreeabil surprised at the taste displayed. There were two ott; ings to tea, after which a concert was given, preside over by Rev Geo Curtis (Pastor). Messrs E Leigh Ow, Isaac Wilkinson were the soloists and received be encores. Messrs C Furness and John Darbystore" delighted the audience with their humorous recitation°, Mr W Wilkinson presided at the piano. Light refresh, meats was served during the evening. Much emu.° merit were also caused by a button sewing competition_ for geniernen. A hearty vote of thanks to the artiste brought this happy and successful evening to a close.</p>
        <p>Three girls were asphyxiated in Berlin by gas' one Off them having turned on the gas during an attack of somnambulism. Five old age pensioners in Northampton—Mrs SlB,toef (72), Mr Slater (72), Mrs Nutt (80), Mrs Clipson and Frederick Corey (85)—have given up their florae' and have rented a house together, sharing all the caorls•</p>
        <p>SPOTS ON FACE ALSO ON HANDS' 3, Whitelock St., Off North St., Leeds, Eng."; "The spots began on my face and on my hands; et3tl3-d of the spots were blackheads and the others ope°e t like scurf and the itching was dreadful. I could 130 sleep and I could not eat, and I used to go mad with't myself through this terrible itching. We bad bout; a all kinds of things and nothing did me any good a all. At last my sister looking through the Patterd book saw the advertisement of Cuticura Soap 3,00 Ointment in, so she said, 'Now Sarah try it.' first day I used it the itching stopped and the° "far spots came off gradually, and it took three weel°3 not curing, and I know my face is grand. I really °3ns-ticl forget the treatment and I keep on buying it t: a, I shall always use it." (Signed) Miss Sarah C°Lie April 27, 1912. iste Cuticura Soap and Ointment are sold by obeLa_st everywhere. A sample of each with 32-p. book Puae free from nearest depot : Newbury, 27, Charterhew.; Sq., London; It Towns &amp; Co., Sydney, N•S' Lennon, Ltd., Cape Town ; Muller, Maclean Calcutta and Bombay ; " Cuticura," Boston, p Tender-faced men should shave with duticura Shaving Stick. Sample free.</p>
