      <div type="article" xml:id="PressMint-GB_1913-04-12_WidnesExaminer_art0050" n="art0050">
        <p>'STEPHEN M.OSS &amp; SONS LIMITED SHOEING AND GENERAL SMITHS, ALL KINDS OF AGRICULTURAL IMPLEMENFS STEAM, GASot OIL ENGINES SUPPLIED, FIXE AND REPAIRED, ALL KINDS OF WHEELS HOOPED. HOT WATER ENGINEERS, &amp;c. WnR.KR • AnA DEMINTRF,F.T. W A MITWITON</p>
